{"1618210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Speedbreak Hyperdrive", "steam_appid": 1618210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >High Speed Platforming Action</h2>Use Syrus’s hyper speed abilities to traverse through fast-paced platforming levels. Fly through the air using launch pads and ramps, perform tricks to blast through stages with style, and boost through enemies to race to the goal!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618210/extras/ad135b1067753c06eafaf3744322a100.poster.avif?t=1760416589\" width=610 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618210/extras/ad135b1067753c06eafaf3744322a100.webm?t=1760416589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618210/extras/ad135b1067753c06eafaf3744322a100.mp4?t=1760416589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >High-Octane Combo System</h2>Speedbreak’s compelling combo system keeps the action going at top speed, encouraging stylish and energetic gameplay. Charge through enemies, perform tricks, and more to chase those high scores!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618210/extras/386fdef9e46dcf9aa24d4ec8889c9a15.poster.avif?t=1760416589\" width=610 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618210/extras/386fdef9e46dcf9aa24d4ec8889c9a15.webm?t=1760416589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618210/extras/386fdef9e46dcf9aa24d4ec8889c9a15.mp4?t=1760416589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Speedrunning Arcade Fun</h2>Every level features multiple paths and a scoring system, tracking time completion, tricks performed, enemies defeated, and crystal rings collected. The higher the overall score, the better!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618210/extras/9a0d53bd8de2b08e1e4e15809fb96759.poster.avif?t=1760416589\" width=610 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618210/extras/9a0d53bd8de2b08e1e4e15809fb96759.webm?t=1760416589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618210/extras/9a0d53bd8de2b08e1e4e15809fb96759.mp4?t=1760416589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >High Speed Platforming Action</h2>Use Syrus’s hyper speed abilities to traverse through fast-paced platforming levels. Fly through the air using launch pads and ramps, perform tricks to blast through stages with style, and boost through enemies to race to the goal!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618210/extras/ad135b1067753c06eafaf3744322a100.poster.avif?t=1760416589\" width=610 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618210/extras/ad135b1067753c06eafaf3744322a100.webm?t=1760416589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618210/extras/ad135b1067753c06eafaf3744322a100.mp4?t=1760416589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >High-Octane Combo System</h2>Speedbreak’s compelling combo system keeps the action going at top speed, encouraging stylish and energetic gameplay. Charge through enemies, perform tricks, and more to chase those high scores!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618210/extras/386fdef9e46dcf9aa24d4ec8889c9a15.poster.avif?t=1760416589\" width=610 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618210/extras/386fdef9e46dcf9aa24d4ec8889c9a15.webm?t=1760416589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618210/extras/386fdef9e46dcf9aa24d4ec8889c9a15.mp4?t=1760416589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Speedrunning Arcade Fun</h2>Every level features multiple paths and a scoring system, tracking time completion, tricks performed, enemies defeated, and crystal rings collected. The higher the overall score, the better!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618210/extras/9a0d53bd8de2b08e1e4e15809fb96759.poster.avif?t=1760416589\" width=610 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618210/extras/9a0d53bd8de2b08e1e4e15809fb96759.webm?t=1760416589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618210/extras/9a0d53bd8de2b08e1e4e15809fb96759.mp4?t=1760416589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>", "short_description": "Speedbreak Hyperdrive is a high speed, action platformer. Rush through thrilling, action-packed stages with speed and style.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618210/header.jpg?t=1760416589", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618210/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760416589", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.ak